  "title": "ui: Fix help url comments",
  "description": "We used to open HTML Help on Windows, in which case the functions\nthat retrieved a URL returned NULL. We don't do that anymore\n(6bfab69d14d39863730f1c6c7bd278ec9f1e1673), which makes the text\nabout \"If the attempt fails NULL will be returned\" confusing.\n\nIn fact these functions are guaranteed to return a non null value,\neven in the unexpected and defaults cases.",
